; The English strings are the library's built-in ones (dt_core.c); a
; translation is a .ct of this file, built with any catalog compiler and
; put in LOCALE:Catalogs/<language>/sys/datatypes.catalog.
; The ids are DTERROR_ (2000-2009), DTMSG_TYPE_OFFSET + DTF_ (2100-2103)
; and the GID_ group ids (four letters as one number).

